# Humanity in Frames

### A Place of Daily Inspiration

**Inspire • Learn • Grow**

Humanity in Frames is a full-stack inspirational web application created to provide a peaceful place for visitors to pause, reflect, discover meaningful ideas, and explore the shared experiences that connect humanity.

Created by **Luis R. Lopez**.

---
. 
## About the Project

Humanity in Frames was created around a simple idea: even a few quiet moments can change the direction of a day.
In the Hopes that it will help someone in any way. To give a moment of reflection of spirit lifting of being united 
with others that feel the same need for comforting our spirit our soul our consciousness. 
To Reset and reconnect with Humanity and with Mother Nature and Earth

The site combines four forms of inspiration:

- Quotes that introduce a thought
- Books that encourage deeper learning
- Images that create reflection
- Stories that connect those ideas to human experiences

The goal was to create an uncluttered and welcoming environment rather than a traditional information-heavy website.

---

## Features

### Daily Inspiration
Visitors can request a new inspirational quote and author.

### Recommended Reading
The application retrieves book recommendations through the Google Books API. Book information includes the title, author, publication year, cover image, and a link for further exploration.

A fallback image is displayed when a book cover is unavailable.

### Inspirational Carousel
A rotating image carousel presents photography focused on people, nature, travel, reflection, and shared humanity.

### Stories of Humanity
A curated collection of external reading, audio, and video links allows visitors to continue exploring inspirational human stories.

### About Page
The About page explains the philosophy behind Humanity in Frames using reflective writing, symbolic icons, and personal imagery.

